<title>JAPAN: Chugai to issue 50 mln Eurodlr warrant.</title>
<headline>Chugai to issue 50 mln Eurodlr warrant.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Chugai Pharmaceutical</p>
<p>Co Ltd</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Nomura International Plc</p>
<p> TYPE warrant	     ISSUE NO		AMT   50 million dollar</p>
<p> COUPON		     ISS PRICE	     MATURITY 19.Sep.00</p>
<p> EXERCISE FRM 3.Oct.96  EXERCISE TO 5.Sep.00</p>
<p> LAST MOODY		 PAY DATE 19.Sep.96  INT PAY</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		   SIGN DATE 10.Sep.96 SUB DATE</p>
<p> LAST JCR		   LAST JBRI	     LAST NIS</p>
<p>The exercise price will be decided on September 10. The coupon was not decided yet.</p>
</text>
